==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*6 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dolphina]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a simple Sir Metal Seal stage with Traitless enemies as the main support. You can use the Metal enemies as a stepping stone for [[Bowler Cat (Rare Cat)|Bowler Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]], while [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] demolishes both H.Nah and Dolphina. Also make sure to use [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cat]] to tank against Sir Metal Seal, as well as [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoopmaster Cat]] to [[Freeze]] Sir Metal Seal.

==Trivia==
*Floating Bus Stop and [[Ink Museum]] are designed like late [[Stories of Legend]] stages, [[Coral Housing]] and [[Kelp Campsite]] are designed like [[Uncanny Legends]] stages, and [[Renovated Shipwreck]] and [[Jetsam Lookout]] are typical [[Zero Legends]] stages.

